    <div  class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-one-column paragraph--view-mode--default light-mode background-white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-center">
          <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-8">
            
                            <center><h3>A Leading Equities Platform on Wall Street</h3><p>Our sales &amp; trading teams facilitate public offerings in our core sectors and dedicate significant levels of firm capital to ensure the highest aftermarket support. We are a market maker and/or transact in 2,500 securities, offering traditional, algorithmic and program trading approaches. Our 50+ publishing analysts produce industry-leading research on 900+ small-, mid- and large-cap companies. Our investor conferences and roadshows provide access to management teams from leading companies.</p></center>
                        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  
          

<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--_-or-4-up-stat-callout paragraph--view-mode--default background-white">
  <div class="container"> 
          <div class="row stat-callout-grid"> 
                    <div class="stat-callout-grid--item column-4">
              <div class="callout-content">
                <div class="inner">
                  <h3 class="callout">No. 3</h3>
                  <p><span>SMID cap liquidity provider</span>*</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="stat-callout-grid--item column-4">
              <div class="callout-content">
                <div class="inner">
                  <h3 class="callout">No. 1</h3>
                  <p><span>for facilitating corporate access with investors*</span></p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="stat-callout-grid--item column-4">
              <div class="callout-content">
                <div class="inner">
                  <h3 class="callout">No. 4</h3>
                  <p><span>Largest domestic account base, No. 12 largest global account base</span>**</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
                    <div class="stat-callout-grid--item column-4">
              <div class="callout-content">
                <div class="inner">
                  <h3 class="callout">330+</h3>
                  <p>Professionals</p>
                </div>
