</div>
              <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--_-up-service-cards paragraph--view-mode--default dark-mode background-teal">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row justify-center">
                <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-8">
                                            <div class="text-center"><h1>Top-Ranked Capabilities</h1></div>
                                                                <div class="row service-cards-grid">
                                                        <div class="col col-lg-6 col-md-4 single-service-card">
                                <span></span>
                                                                                                                                                <a
                                            class="heading-3"
                                            href="/research"
                                            target=""
                                            aria-label="">
                                            Equity Research
                                        </a>
                                                                                                    <p>Gain access to our award-winning, proprietary research on more than&nbsp;900 companies&nbsp;in the consumer, energy, financial services, healthcare,&nbsp;macro&nbsp;and technology sectors.</p><p>Client-only Piper Sandler meetings,&nbsp;conferences&nbsp;and reports keep you up-to-speed with today's most dynamic companies, new opportunities and industry trends.</p>
                            </div>
                                                        <div class="col col-lg-6 col-md-4 single-service-card">
                                <span></span>
                                                                                                                                                <a
                                            class="heading-3"
                                            href="/equities/corporate-access"
                                            target=""
                                            aria-label="">
                                            Corporate Access
                                        </a>
                                                                                                    <p>Our sectorized corporate access professionals produce an expansive offering of bespoke events that allow participants to dive deep into specific themes. The team provides direct access to corporate clients via conferences, unique events, roadshows and one-on-one meetings.</p>
                            </div>
                                                        <div class="col col-lg-6 col-md-4 single-service-card">
                                <span></span>
                                                                                                                                                <a
                                            class="heading-3"
                                            href="/equities/equity-sales"
                                            target=""
                                            aria-label="">
                                            Equity Sales
                                        </a>
                                                                                                    <p>Equity sales&nbsp;combines deep expertise in both domestic and global markets with an award-winning, premier research brand. Our experienced sales team is a trusted partner of choice with an average tenure of more than 13+ years, including 25+ years among regional sales managers. We provide a unique combination of generalist and specialty sales that ranked top 5 in multiple industry verticals.</p>
                            </div>
                                                        <div class="col col-lg-6 col-md-4 single-service-card">
                                <span></span>
                                                                                                                                                <a
                                            class="heading-3"
                                            href="/equities/equity-trading"
                                            target=""
                                            aria-label="">
                                            Equity Trading
                                        </a>
                                                                                                    <p>Our traditional high-touch trading model has consistently earned industry accolades from independent firms such as Elkins/McSherry, Pensions &amp; Investments and Greenwich Associates for minimizing market impact and helping clients reduce transaction costs.&nbsp;Learn more&nbsp;about our algorithmic strategies and program trading services.</p>
                            </div>
                                                        <div class="col col-lg-6 col-md-4 single-service-card">
                                <span></span>
                                                                                                                                                <a
                                            class="heading-3"
                                            href="/investment-banking/corporate-and-venture-services"
                                            target=""
                                            aria-label="">
                                            Corporate &amp; Venture Group
                                        </a>
                                                                                                    <p>The Piper Sandler&nbsp;corporate &amp; venture group offers highly integrated trading and specialized investment services tailored to meet specific needs. Our experienced team provides dedicated support, in which we leverage the firm's institutional sales &amp; trading platforms.</p>
                            </div>
                                                        <div class="col col-lg-6 col-md-4 single-service-card">
                                <span></span>
                                                                                                                                                <a
                                            class="heading-3"
                                            href="/private-markets-trading"
                                            target=""
                                            aria-label="">
                                            Private Markets Trading
                                        </a>
                                                                                                    <p>Our seasoned team facilitates trading in privately held securities, specializing in late-stage, venture-backed companies. We provide liquidity for shareholders and access for private investors, ensuring every deal is executed with trusted, vetted partners.</p>
                            </div>
                                                    </div>
                                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
            </div>

            


